# --- Brand source material: local only, never committed --------------------
#
# This repository is public. Everything below is licensed stock, or derived
# from it, and the licence forbids sub-licensing and inclusion in an online
# archive. The shipped mark is original geometry and depends on none of it.
#
# The app loads brand assets only from frontend/assets/brand/. Nothing in a
# build may reference Brand/ at all.
#
# This is an allowlist, not a list of patterns, because the list of patterns
# already failed. New_Logo.png was added on 2026-08-18, matched none of
# Screenshot* / mantis-* / LLMantis/ / *.zip, and reached the public remote
# carrying the owner's real name in a Canva XMP block. A new filename cannot
# outrun an allowlist; it walks straight past a list of names.
Brand/*
!Brand/llmantis-*.svg

